From 167b2655fd60a4b6f3624a80334ce4222e26b786 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 05:05:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add full Dealer CRM for staff:
 Overview/Ledger/Orders/Visits/Insights tabs + AI assistant
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rebuilds the staff-facing dealer detail screen into a 5-tab CRM (approved
from mockup/dealer-crm-mockup.html): real running-balance ledger with
Tally-style voucher expand, order line-item expand, and an Insights tab
with 9 real reports (sales trend, top products, payment collection,
ageing, GST summary, order status, returns, order frequency, visit
conversion) — each with its own independent period picker (including
custom date ranges) and PDF/Excel export. Every report reads live data
via new scope-checked RPCs, never fabricated numbers.

Adds an AI assistant in two places — per-dealer inside Insights, and
dealer-book-wide on the Sales dashboard itself — both answering in
whatever language the rep asks in. Reuses the existing /api/chat backend
already live for admin's AI Assistant tab; no new infrastructure needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
